00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:19.460
Rui, you like asparagus, right? You can have it.

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:22.250
No! You eat your own properly!

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:22.920
I can't!

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.250
The ones today are particularly raw!

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.500
You know that's why your skin's been unhealthy lately!

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.040
That's not it! That's because of the alcohol!

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:37.750
It's kinda nice. It feels like we've become a family.

00:00:37.750 --> 00:00:38.170
Huh?

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:46.330
That reminds me, why did you end up
running away from home?

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:49.790
What? Um... That's...

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:53.040
I forgot!

00:00:55.710 --> 00:00:58.460
Maybe he got caught
with some naughty DVDs or something...

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:04.330
Mijuku mujou saredo

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:04.330
Inexperienced, heartless, but even so,

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:13.490
Utsukushiku are

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:13.490
Be beautiful

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:24.450
No Destiny fusawashiku nai

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:24.450
No Destiny, unworthy

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.350
You okay...?

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.350
Did something happen...?

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.350
I'll...

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:26.350
