that I wanted to try to talk to you, Tachibana-san.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:19.960
I know!

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:24.420
As a token of getting acquainted,
I'll give you the best one I've made.

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:27.880
Usa-chan!

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:34.710
Rui.

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.500
Let's have lunch.

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:37.830
Oh, okay.

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:39.580
