The other girls are pretty put off by that.

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:04.500
At any rate, the way she flirts with guys is extreme...

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:06.920
Like during summer,
she purposely shows off her cleavage!

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:09.130
Or bending down in front
of the guys to show her panties!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:10.380
There's even a rumor she's gone so far
as to have a six-way! So gross!

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:11.460
A total bitch.
There's even a rumor she's gone so far
as to have a six-way! So gross!

00:04:11.460 --> 00:04:12.250
There's even a rumor she's gone so far
as to have a six-way! So gross!

00:04:18.580 --> 00:04:19.540
Rui...?

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:27.330
Even if that's true...

00:04:27.960 --> 00:04:32.420
whether or not it's better for me
to hang out with her is up to me to decide.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.170
Tachibana-san~!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:42.380
Um...

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.790
Momo Kashiwabara. You can call me Momo.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.790
You know how you accepted the bunny this morning?

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:54.630
Well, I secretly tried making this during break.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:56.420
Tachibana-san.

00:04:57.500 --> 00:04:58.710
As a present!

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.500
Th-thanks...

00:05:03.080 --> 00:05:05.500
You going home alone?

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:06.880
Yeah...

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:09.420
Then let's head out together!

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.960
Mmm! Yum!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:22.250
Hey, is it okay with you, Tachibana-san,
if I call you by your first name, too?

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.290
I guess...

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:25.960
All right! Then, Rui-Rui it is.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:27.670
Why repeat it...?

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:30.330
Hey, Momo...

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:34.210
Um, do you have plenty of experience
being in relationships?

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:40.330
Did you hear that from someone?

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:46.210
I wouldn't call it plenty, but if I was
just counting the number of people...

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:52.170
Thirty people... or so?

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:56.460
Oh, but not two at the same time, you know?
I do break up properly before going out again.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:05:58.880
Oh, well, not that it matters to me, but...

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.830
Um, then what about the six-way fetish...?

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.420
Uh, six-way feta? Like cheese?

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.540
I guess that's just a rumor...

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:10.000
You know, somehow things
just don't work out in the end.

00:06:10.000 --> 00:06:16.130
At first, they're all lovey-dovey, but after going out
for a while, they start getting violent,

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:21.330
or they'll cheat on me with multiple people,
or steal money from my wallet,

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:23.790
and there was even one who kept me locked up.

00:06:24.580 --> 00:06:27.540
So, you're one of those so-called "enablers"...

00:06:27.920 --> 00:06:28.380
Huh?

00:06:28.380 --> 00:06:30.040
Oh, no, it's nothing.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:36.500
Possibly due to me being unstable because of that,
I don't have many friends.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:38.750
So...

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:43.330
If it's okay with you, I'd be really happy
if you'd be friends with me!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:44.460
Sure...

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:50.250
Rui-Rui!

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:52.500
Let's go to the music classroom together!

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:58.580
Keep things

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:58.580
tidy and

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:58.580
in order

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:02.830
Hoshino Bookstore

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:11.710
It's rare to see you hanging out with someone.

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.000
I'm Momo Kashiwabara.

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:20.380
Oh, thank you for the introduction. I'm Natsuo Fujii.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.670
Are you Rui-Rui's friend?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.540
Ah... Well, something like that.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:26.040
Shopping?

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.210
Uh, well, more like browsing and reading.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:42.670
Wow!

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:45.960
You read difficult-looking books, huh?

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.710
Oh no, not really.

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:51.130
Literary writings can be difficult to get into,

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:55.130
but these over here have more popular literature,
and there are easy-to-read short stories too...

00:07:57.630 --> 00:07:59.750
If you're interested, I can lend you a paperback.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.630
Huh? Sure...

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:05.210
I might want to take a look...

00:08:18.710 --> 00:08:20.290
That was close...!

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:25.170
Natsuo-kun, you're so kind.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:27.750
Huh? Oh no, isn't this the least one does?

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.290
