00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:32.080
What?! Oh, but that all depends on the situation...

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:33.130
What kind of situation?

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:34.630
You know, a situation.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:35.290
Oh really...?

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:38.750
Well, we still have places to stop by, so...

00:08:39.000 --> 00:08:40.460
Okay. See ya.

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:44.830
Let's see. Which way was the crepe place?

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.790
Hey, Rui-Rui.

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:51.830
Does Natsuo-kun have a girlfriend?

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:58.670
About Natsuo-kun... Is it okay, if I fall for him?

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:15.380
Why are you asking me something like that...?

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:18.380
Well, he is your friend, Rui-Rui,

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:22.580
and I thought that just in case he happens to be the
guy you like, Rui-Rui, then that would be wrong of me.

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:27.290
It doesn't really matter to me.

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.880
Really? I'm glad!

00:09:30.080 --> 00:09:33.960
Then please support me so that I'll be able
to go out with Natsuo-kun.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:46.790
Huh?

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:48.710
Rui-chan, you going home?

00:09:50.960 --> 00:09:52.750
I feel a little feverish...

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:55.500
Can you get home by yourself?

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:56.540
Yeah...

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:59.290
What's up with that? You sound like her boyfriend.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.750
Huh? How so...?

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:11.960
Kashiwabara-san?!

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.040
Momo...

00:10:13.670 --> 00:10:17.540
I was thinking it's kinda hard to talk to you
