00:10:25.250 --> 00:10:26.170
Huh?

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:29.830
If there happens to be a time
when you're totally free or something,

00:10:29.830 --> 00:10:32.130
I was thinking it'd be nice to hear from you...

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:38.170
Your hands are pretty sweaty...

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:42.460
S-send me a reply to that via LINE, okay?

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.790
Side-tie panties...

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.670
Would you like to go out on a date

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:51.670
