00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:35.750
A towel, and hot water, and pajamas.

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:39.040
I'm sticky with sweat. I want to
wipe myself down and change clothes.

00:11:45.170 --> 00:11:46.540
You okay?

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:49.580
Is there anything else you need? Wait! You... hey!

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.040
Why are you getting flustered at this point?

00:11:52.040 --> 00:11:54.710
You could at least wait until I leave the room!

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:58.920
Wait! Can you take care of my back, please?

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:12.630
Younger sister...! Younger sister...!

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:15.500
Sick person...! Sick person...!

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:22.250
Younger sister...! Sick person...!

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.140
From: Hina

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.140
Sorry for the late reply!

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.140
Just saw your text. (>_<)

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.140
Is Rui doing okay?

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.140
Looks like I'll be getting home late today

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.140
so can I ask you to take care of her,

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.140
Sorry!!

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:32.140
Natsuo-kun?

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:35.290
For real?

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:48.960
You don't have to stay with me the whole time.

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:51.250
Well, I was asked to take care of you, so...

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.920
Hey, do you...?

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:57.790
Hmm?

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:01.210
Do you have someone that you like?

00:13:01.210 --> 00:13:03.670
Huh? What's with that all of a sudden?

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:10.170
Momo has... apparently got a crush on you.

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:12.920
Hang on! You sure it's okay to tell me that?

00:13:12.920 --> 00:13:15.080
Well, she didn't tell me to keep it a secret.

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:20.960
She did ask me to support her,
but when I think of you and Momo going out together...

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:22.420
it kinda...

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:24.880
it kinda makes me feel uneasy and...

