00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:24.250
I guess I just have to...

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:34.040
A-are you sure about this?

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:36.040
Yeah...

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:43.330
It... It went in...!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:49.710
It looks like her fever's gone down, now.

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:51.380
Thank goodness...

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:55.420
And this is all due to Natsuo-kun
taking care of her. Thank you.

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:57.290
Oh... Well...

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.580
What are you crying for?

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:06.920
Well... you guys are at that delicate age
as young adults, so honestly, I was a little worried...

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:12.170
But you guys are getting along just fine as siblings,
so I'm glad it was just unnecessary worrying...

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:16.080
Let's continue as a family of five to help each other out!

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:17.750
Yeah...

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:23.290
Family... Right...

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:37.670
Oh...! Sorry about yesterday. I don't use LINE, so...

00:15:37.880 --> 00:15:42.540
