00:16:03.630 --> 00:16:04.500
What...?

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:06.040
I guess it's fine, but...

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:09.250
It's a little awkward, becoming "brothers" with a friend.

00:16:09.420 --> 00:16:10.330
Huh?!

00:16:10.330 --> 00:16:12.920
Well, she and I did it once, so...

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:14.250
N-no way!

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:15.460
You guys were going out?

00:16:15.460 --> 00:16:17.080
No, there was no going out.

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.420
Have you ever seen the dolls on her book bag?

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:22.630
You know she's the kind of dicey girl
you definitely don't want to get too involved with.

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:27.790
Ta-dah!

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:32.170
I made a lot because I thought we could eat together!

00:16:32.170 --> 00:16:35.330
It's to be shared. Feel free to eat up!

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:38.420
Do you do this kinda thing for everyone?

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:41.460
Nope, I don't. Only for the person I like.

00:16:42.750 --> 00:16:44.290
You're pretty open, aren't you?

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:46.290
Well, yeah.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:49.710
If you don't do your best, then you might regret it, right?

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:56.330
If you've done everything you can and it
doesn't work out, then it can't be helped, but...

00:16:56.330 --> 00:17:00.210
It would be tougher to keep thinking
"What if?" if you don't do anything.

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:03.210
If you don't communicate properly,
then you won't be able to let go properly.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.790
You're incredible...

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:11.000
Did you fall for me? Wanna go out?

00:17:12.330 --> 00:17:13.880
Is something bothering you?

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:14.750
What?

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:19.460
You're bad at hiding things.
If you don't mind that it's me, wanna talk about it?

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:21.080
No, it's okay...

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:22.290
It's all right!

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:29.170
I'm ashamed... of myself.

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:37.000
There's something that I want so badly...
but I can't communicate properly or let go.

00:17:37.670 --> 00:17:39.960
Even though I know that it's out of my reach.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.670
But... I...

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:48.920
Whoa!

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:50.790
Sorry.

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:55.920
When I saw how sad you looked, Natsuo-kun,
it just made me want to...

00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:02.130
Wanna come... to my house today?

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:11.460
Are you not used to kissing?

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:14.000
Yeah...

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:27.750
It's fine this way. I have to hurry up
and get Sensei out of my head.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:30.380
There shouldn't be any problems if it's this girl.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:36.080
There are some rumors,
but she's not family and she's not Sensei.

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:38.920
Why not?

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:41.380
If I just go out with this girl, then...

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:48.750
Got a text? It's okay if you want to check it.

00:18:48.750 --> 00:18:50.210
Sorry, really...

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:56.170
Inbox: (2)

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:56.170
From: Rui

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:56.170
It sounds like everyone will be

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:56.170
working late again tonight.

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:56.170
Is there anything you want

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:56.170
to eat for dinner?

00:18:57.920 --> 00:18:59.500
A friend?

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:04.000
Oh, no... from family.
They're asking what I want to eat for dinner.

00:19:04.000 --> 00:19:07.130
Lucky. Do you eat meals as a family?

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:10.790
Typically, yeah... Do you not eat like that a lot?

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:14.960
Um... not really. Actually, that's every day.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:19.960
Papa and Mama haven't really
gotten along for a long time now.

00:19:19.960 --> 00:19:22.460
And it seems like they're busy with work, too...

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:25.630
So usually, I eat by myself at home.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:32.250
Now then, enough about that. Let's continue!

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:35.790
Hey...

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:39.750
Will you undo my buttons...?

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:42.130
I'm not wearing a bra right now, so...

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:04.130
Th-they're not from recently or anything.

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:07.330
There was just a time like that, that's all...

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:12.750
I'm totally fine now, so don't let it bother you. Really...

00:20:29.460 --> 00:20:30.420
Natsuo-kun...?

00:20:30.420 --> 00:20:32.330
Uh, hey...

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:35.130
Is there a supermarket nearby?

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.540
Yaki-udon...?

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:44.790
Yeah. This is the one thing I'm fairly confident about.

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:52.670
It's delicious! You can cook. That's amazing!

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:58.960
It's a little different, isn't it? Eating with people.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:04.040
I get that...

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:09.170
If there's times when you're lonely, call me.
Let's eat together again.

00:21:14.000 --> 00:21:15.330
Thanks...

00:21:21.630 --> 00:21:23.880
Y-you don't have to cry...

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:29.920
Sorry. You know, up until now,
I've always kept these scars hidden.

00:21:30.460 --> 00:21:33.330
But they get found out when I get naked,
no matter what...

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:38.290
There's been lots of times when guys have seen this
and they get put off or distance themselves from me.

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:46.290
But this is the first time anyone
has said something like that to me, so...

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:58.130
Well then, starting today, we're-

00:21:58.130 --> 00:21:59.130
Not going out.

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:01.420
Why not?! Do you not like me?!

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:03.290
No, that's not what I mean...

00:22:04.130 --> 00:22:06.330
I was thinking things over and...

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:10.830
maybe it's better if neither one of us go out with people
we need to depend on, or something...

00:22:11.920 --> 00:22:13.920
Aw! What's up with that?

00:22:15.250 --> 00:22:17.630
And after you've been that nice to me?

00:22:18.830 --> 00:22:20.170
Honestly...

00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:22.170
you're so mean!

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:32.040
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni natte yuku

00:22:23.000 --> 00:22:32.040
Ah, I'll be selfish to you

00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:36.830
Domestic Girlfriend

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:44.380
Sasai na hibi no nandemo nai yasashisa wo

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:44.380
Your little kindness in normal days

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:53.960
Daiji ni shimatte nandomo akete nagamete iru

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:53.960
I cherish them and open them often to look

00:22:54.540 --> 00:23:02.840
Kimi no honshin kikezu ni karamawari shitari shite

00:22:54.540 --> 00:23:02.840
I wouldn't be able to ask you about your feelings and losing my self

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:11.130
Kantan na koto hodo muzukashiku natte iru

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:11.130
The easiest things become harder to do

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:15.090
Otona ni nareba

00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:15.090
If I become an adult,

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:27.590
Konna koto de nayamazu ni umaku ikirareru kana

00:23:16.420 --> 00:23:27.590
I can live well without worrying about something like this?

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:32.840
Ah kimi ni dake wagamama ni naru

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:32.840
Ah, I become selfish just towards you

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:37.040
Dondon jibun rashiku mo nakunatte

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:37.040
I'll lose my self more & more

00:23:37.170 --> 00:23:41.590
Ah mata kimochi ga sakibashitte

00:23:37.170 --> 00:23:41.590
Ah, my feelings get ahead of myself again

00:23:41.590 --> 00:23:46.090
Dondon matomo ja nakunatteku kara

00:23:41.590 --> 00:23:46.090
I can't stand it more

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:51.540
Sotchi wo minai de

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:51.540
Don't look that way

00:23:52.960 --> 00:23:57.960
Episode 6

00:23:52.960 --> 00:23:57.960
Right Here And Now,

00:23:52.960 --> 00:23:57.960
Try To Kiss

00:23:53.790 --> 00:23:57.250
Right here and now, try to kiss.
